       Q-series watchers shell out to it via AdbLocator, which resolves this
       bundled copy first. Committed (unlike openrgb/ffmpeg) so the service
       runs on a host with no Android SDK. Slimmed to adb + its direct deps
       (Windows: AdbWinApi/AdbWinUsbApi/libwinpthread; macOS thinned to arm64);
       fastboot and the other tools are dropped. -->
  <ItemGroup Condition="$([MSBuild]::IsOSPlatform('Windows')) AND Exists('Bundled\win-x64\adb')">
    <Content Include="Bundled\win-x64\adb\**\*.*">
